    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Then why has that honeyed word ‘Kanne’ not fallen from your lips? Turmoil in your eyes... Kannala! Milk!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d011",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 19,
       "printed_page": 18
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The source's intimate address words `கண்ணே` and `கண்ணாளா` are retained because Vasantha Sena is consciously performing sweetness."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u016",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Milk?...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d012",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 19,
       "printed_page": 18
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u017",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Why, oh-ho! Has the play come back to mind?...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d013",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u018",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Nothing like that...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d014",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u019",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Why speak through sighs? Ask me directly. My husband Kesari Varman... I had told you that, unable to bear seeing our love, he ran away from the town...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d015",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u020",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Yes! Now???",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d016",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u021",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "In the play Devasena poisons and kills her husband! And you too, believing it to be true......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d017",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u022",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "Taking both cups in her hands...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "source-action-before-unlabelled-speech",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "description": "Vasantha Sena takes both cups in her hands before an unlabelled quoted fragment."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u023",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "‘Of these, whichever you wish, you may...’",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "source-unlabelled-dialogue-fragment",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "description": "Quoted fragment after the two-cup action; no speaker label is printed."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The source leaves the phrase unfinished and unlabelled; the English does the same."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u024",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "No... you give me one...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d018",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u025",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "No, take whichever you prefer. Suspicion is a troublesome disease. A dagger that cuts a life of love apart... it turns even a warrior into a coward... here, take one... (then, thinking)... no, not even that... I will take both myself.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d019",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The disease/dagger/warrior-coward rhetorical chain is preserved.",
      "`சாப்பிடுகிறேன்` is rendered neutrally as `take both` because the source refers to the two offered cup portions rather than supplying a clear modern drinking verb."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u026",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "(In astonishment)......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "parenthetical-performance-direction",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "description": "Source `ஆச்சரியமாய்` cue after Vasantha Sena says she will take both."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u027",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்தி",
    "text": "Forgive me, Maharaja? For thirteen years I have lived as your chaste wife—I ask on the strength of that. Ornaments—life of luxury—royal pleasures—enough... please give me... saffron robes! A begging bowl in my hand! Do not refuse. Give me leave to go......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d020",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The renunciation performance is kept as a sequence of abrupt demands rather than smoothed into a single request."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u028",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Go...... you?...... where, my dear......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d021",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u029",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "The world is vast, Prabhu! In its crowds I will become a mere drop—I will spend my life chanting your name.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d022",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 20,
       "printed_page": 19
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The drop-in-the-crowd image and devotional performance are retained."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u030",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "They have plotted to set fire to my happy life lying at your feet!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d023",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u031",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "A plot? Who?",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d024",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u032",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "The Maharani herself!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d025",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u033",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Who... Padmavathi?......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d026",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u034",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "கேசரியின் குரல்",
    "text": "No... a brazen lie?... O king who rules the realm... do not be sacrificed to syrupy speech!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d027",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "`பச்சைப் புளுகு` / `பாகு மொழி` becomes `brazen lie` / `syrupy speech` to retain the contrast and rhetorical bite."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u035",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Look, Swami, look...... What I heard is true...... They say the Maharani is even holding secret counsel...... to separate me from you......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d028",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u036",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "It does need looking into! (To the guard) Search and find who spoke here.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d029",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The label-attached guard instruction remains inside the dialogue-linked unit."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u037",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "(The soldiers run toward the direction from which the sound came.)",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "parenthetical-stage-direction",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "description": "Soldiers run toward the direction from which the sound came."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u038",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோகரன்",
    "text": "A smear of civet on a festering wound! Patience—to sear away that evildoer's false disguise......... Enough, Amma, of all this endurance. Give the order. I will make that woman who ruins the land disappear without a trace!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d030",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The source's dense alliterative `ப`-sequence cannot be mechanically reproduced in English, but its wound/perfume/false-mask imagery and accelerating force are retained."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u039",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "பத்மா",
    "text": "Manohara! Wait......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d031",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u040",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "(The sword in the box there is handed to Manoharan.)",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "parenthetical-stage-direction",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "description": "A sword from the box there is given to Manoharan."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u041",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோ",
    "text": "Amma! (A sweep of the sword) The masquerader Vasantha is finished!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d032",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The source action attached to Manoharan's utterance remains inside the linked unit."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u042",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "பத",
    "text": "Wait, my son... I ask you to engage in a holier task than that.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d033",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u043",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோ",
    "text": "What is it, Amma?",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d034",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u044",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "பத்மா",
    "text": "Do you know what sword this is?......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d035",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 21,
       "printed_page": 20
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s009-u045",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோ",
    "text": "Even in the play there was a sword like this... yes, I saw it......",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-009.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-009.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s009-d036",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 22,
       "printed_page": 21
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   }
  ]
 }
}
